     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span> or <span data-math=\"amount = percent \\times base\"></span>.</p>\n<p>68% of 280</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = 0.68\\left( {280} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = 190.4\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
